You attack with mindless brutality. The first critical hit inflicted while rampaging increases the rampage duration by 1.

Rampage Bonus: Your physical damage increases by [12%, 20%, 26%, 32%, 37% (TL1-5)].

Rampage Bonus: Your Physical Save increases by [6, 9, 12, 15, 18 (TL1-5)] and Mental Save increases by [6, 9, 12, 15, 18 (TL1-5)].
